          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal Spacing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How big the light is": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光源的大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "产生耀斑所需的亮度。接近 100 时仅最亮、最大的光斑会产生耀斑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "产生星芒所需的亮度。接近 100 时仅最亮、最大的光斑会出现星芒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the beams are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光束的亮度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "黑色区域中扫描线的亮度。提高此值可让扫描线在纯黑处显现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "散景光斑的亮度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可被选中的颜色与拾取颜色之间允许的最大差异"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相邻副本之间的距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕扫描线之间的距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个颜色通道（0–255）与点选颜色之间允许的最大差值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化从边缘向外延伸的距离，以像素为单位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from the light the beams reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光束从光源延伸的距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整覆盖的亮度范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整覆盖的色相范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整覆盖的饱和度范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far into the scene the haze begins: low reaches up to the camera, high leaves all but the farthest parts clear": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雾效开始显现的深度。低值让雾气延伸至相机附近，高值仅在最远处保留雾气。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离焦程度，决定散景光斑的大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以像素为单位设置模糊范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在亮度驱动扫描线位移之前进行的平滑程度，控制起伏由尖锐到圆润。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "红色和蓝色通道向相反方向分离的距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "镜头镀膜效果会让光条有多长一段偏蓝。设为零可保留光源的原色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线扩散的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light wraps around the subject's edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轮廓光从主体边缘向内延伸的宽度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星芒的延伸距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the streaks reach across the picture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光条在图像上的延伸距离。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fine the detail it sharpens: small for crisp texture, larger for a punchier look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制锐化细节的尺度。小半径让纹理更清晰，大半径让锐化感更强。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每帧的显示时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many pixels to expand, contract or feather the selection by": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展、收缩或羽化选区的像素数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个光源产生的星芒数量，模拟镜头光圈叶片的效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像副本的数量，副本逐个变淡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much colored speckle is smoothed into the colors around it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让彩色斑点融入周围颜色的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much fine texture and edges are kept while the grain is smoothed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "降噪时保留细微纹理和边缘的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much grain is smoothed from the picture's brightness": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "减少图像亮度杂色的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制光线散射的程度，在亮部周围生成柔和光晕，并轻微提亮阴影。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制像素量化误差向邻近像素扩散的程度。较低值会让色块更均匀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明亮扫描线在行距中所占的比例，较暗部分的线条更细。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用镜头配置文件中扭曲校正的强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用镜头配置文件中暗角校正的强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the beams break up into separate shafts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光束分成多条光柱的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制曲线对颜色强度的影响。零值与 Photoshop 一致，较低值更侧重亮度，较高值增强色彩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strongly edges and fine detail are brought out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强化边缘和细节的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the light ends on the inside: low feathers it off softly from the edge, high holds it bright and ends it crisply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制光线在主体内部的收边。低值从边缘柔和渐隐，高值保留亮度并形成清晰的内边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置线条、虚线线段及点线圆点的端点形状"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How thick the air is: haze lit by the light, thinner in front of the subject": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空气中的雾效浓度。雾气受光源照亮，主体前方的雾气较淡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How this line's ends are finished": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置此线条的端点形状"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HSL": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HSL lists every color. Color edits one family. Point Color adjusts a color you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL 列出所有色系。「颜色」编辑单个色系。「点颜色」调整你取样的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue and saturation of this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此色轮的色相和饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue around the wheel, saturation outward from the center. Control-click to show the histogram.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "环绕色轮的角度表示色相，距中心的距离表示饱和度。按住 Control 键点按可显示直方图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue Range": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue range where green defringe runs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去除绿边所适用的色相范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue range where purple defringe runs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去除紫边所适用的色相范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue Shift": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相偏移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue shifts the color, Saturation its strength, and Luminance its brightness.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相改变颜色，饱和度控制色彩浓度，明亮度控制颜色的明暗。"
