          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the 16-bit layers' full precision, in a file about twice the size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留 16 位图层的完整精度，文件大小约为两倍"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the source moving with the brush between strokes; off starts every stroke at the source point": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持取样位置与画笔同步移动；关闭后，每笔都从原取样点开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the subject clear of the haze; off, it's hazed by its own distance, so a figure far off is misted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后主体不受雾效影响。关闭后按主体深度计算雾效，远处主体也会被雾气覆盖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep transparent areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留透明区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps local contrast after luminance smoothing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在平滑明亮度后保留局部对比度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps this point fixed. Artwork is not scaled; cropped content remains outside the canvas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定此定位点。图像保持原尺寸，裁掉的内容保留在画布外。"
