    "Text Editing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框使用 macOS 标准编辑快捷键。对话框使用上方的“应用”和“取消”按键。数值字段用方向键 ↑ 或 ↓ 调整，按住 Shift 可增大步长。macOS 标准快捷键包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。在快捷键编辑器中，未录制时可按 Return 保存，或按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Size": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字 · 双击编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑快捷键须搭配 Command、Option 或 Control，避免影响正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That profile isn’t a CMYK output profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配置文件并非 CMYK 输出配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的处理方式。校准强度已接近版本 6。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The aperture's shape: round wide open, a hexagon of blades, an anamorphic oval, or a cat's eye toward the edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择光圈形状：全开时的圆形、模拟光圈叶片的六边形、变形镜头的椭圆形或画面边缘的猫眼形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line ends, and past it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条终点及以外区域的模糊程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line starts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条起点的模糊程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置笔触跟随指针的距离，用于减少手部抖动造成的笔画不平滑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染画布。请尝试使用较小的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置用于绘图的字符，顺序不限。每个位置都会使用墨量最接近该处色调的字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The color before: click to go back to it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按恢复原来的颜色"
          }
        }
